### Create Student
POST localhost:8081/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Alish",
  "surname":"Valiyev",
  "age":19
}

### Get all student
GET localhost:8080/student

### Get by id
GET localhost:8080/student/2

### Create Student
PUT localhost:8080/student/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"Alishjon",
  "surname":"Aliyev",
  "age":18
}

### Delete
GET localhost:8080/student/2



### Filter
POST localhost:8081/student/filter?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "surname": "Valiyev"
}



